ttps://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMijwFBVV95cUxNRDdjMGtpT2Q4VEhzN0ZaeXp1dDBvYTVuYmFRd3hRanUtdFNkQjZBYk1oOFpKU1k2RDFVUkRCcnI4V2k2WkkwLXFwTElNQ1IyMU94ckh1dm1JNWhhVHRQTFF1MzBiTjgxWm1faDlWbEQ4YUk2OVJPZlJobWZUVFpJNjh1cW5hWTJWYjJrZ3VPcw?oc=5","date":"2026-10-29","zh":"西屋空氣煞車技術 (WAB) 庫存預測"},{"title":"Westinghouse Air Brake Technolo (WAB) Q3 FY2026 earnings call transcript","src":"Yahoo Finance","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiigFBVV95cUxNZk1valNVeVBxN2tvTkg4R0wyeXVObzN3WlBMSzFGMkViWFl5RHk5eXd2Ul8zUlVxRzJfb3NKazBTeEdYZWxfM1RGc045QTNWVTRHdDVjU25JSl9SdG42NkZOcV80VVQ1TXJrTENBbzRRd3pKbllPVVJuRy13TXlYUFZzdWpGUU1DTkE?oc=5","date":"2026-10-21","zh":"西屋空氣煞車技術 (WAB) 2026 財年第三季財報電話會議紀錄"},{"title":"[Westinghouse Air Brake Technologies Q3 2026 Earnings Call] Wabtec Lifts EPS Guidance to $10.85-$11.05 as Margin Hits 22.9%, Backlog Tops $31 Billion","src":"BigGo Finance","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiXEFVX3lxTE83aHhLZWZIOHNNamhCV1NiNkNkTHpRNkRieDBjRVRyTnJBOXpzZm1uLWxnWkFrRWFZSFc3R0VlY25tejB5T19YNS12YThCQ2d6Wk1JM3B3UXhTLTNy?oc=5","date":"2026-10-21","zh":"[西屋空氣煞車技術 2026 年第三季財報電話會議] Wabtec 將每股盈餘指引上調至 10.85-11.05 美元，利潤率達到 22.9%，積壓訂單突破 310 億美元"}],"themes":[{"name":"財報","count":3},{"name":"訂單/合約","count":1},{"name":"分析師評等","count":1}],"biz":{"tenk":{"form":"10-K","date":"2026-02-13","period":"2025-12-31","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/943452/000162828026008067/wab-20251231.htm"},"overview":[{"en":"Westinghouse Air Brake Technologies Corporation, doing business as Wabtec Corporation, is a Delaware corporation with headquarters at 30 Isabella Street in Pittsburgh, Pennsylvania. Our telephone number is 412-825-1000, and our website is located at www.wabteccorp.com. Wabtec has approximately 31,000 employees, excluding contingent workers, and operations in over 50 countries. Except as the context otherwise requires, all references to \"we\", \"our\", \"us\", the \"Company\" and \"Wabtec\" refer to Westinghouse Air Brake Technologies Corporation and its consolidated subsidiaries. George Westinghouse founded the original Westinghouse Air Brake Co. in 1869 when he invented the air brake. Westinghouse Air Brake Company (\"WABCO\") was formed in 1990 when it acquired certain assets and operations from American Standard, Inc., now known as Trane (\"Trane\"). The Company went public on the New York Stock E","zh":"西屋空氣煞車技術公司（Wabtec Corporation）是一家德拉瓦州公司，總部位於賓州匹茲堡伊莎貝拉街 30 號。我們的電話號碼是 412-825-1000，我們的網站位於 www.wabteccorp.com。 Wabtec 擁有約 31,000 名員工（不包括臨時工），業務遍及 50 多個國家。除非上下文另有要求，所有提及的「我們」、「我們的」、「本公司」和「西屋煞車」均指西屋空氣煞車技術公司及其合併子公司。喬治·威斯汀豪斯 (George Westinghouse) 於 1869 年發明了空氣煞車器，創立了最初的威斯汀豪斯空氣煞車公司。西屋空氣煞車公司（「WABCO」）成立於 1990 年，當時它從美國標準公司（現稱為特靈公司）收購了某些資產和業務。公司在紐約證券交易所上市"},{"en":"the 1999 merger with MotivePower Industries, Inc. whereby the Company adopted its current name of Westinghouse Air Brake Technologies Corporation, or Wabtec;","zh":"1999 年與 MotivePower Industries, Inc. 合併，公司採用了目前的名稱 Westinghouse Air Brake Technologies Corporation 或 Wabtec；"},{"en":"the 2017 acquisition of Faiveley Transport, S.A. (\"Faiveley Transport\"), a leading provider of value-added, integrated systems and services, primarily for the global transit rail market. Based in France, the Faiveley Transport business has roots to 1919 and made Wabtec a leader in manufacturing pantographs, automatic door mechanisms, air conditioning systems, railway braking systems and couplers; and,","zh":"2017 年收購 Faiveley Transport, S.A.（「Faiveley Transport」），這是一家領先的增值整合系統和服務提供商，主要面向全球交通鐵路市場。 Faiveley Transport 業務總部位於法國，其歷史可追溯至 1919 年，使西屋制動成為受電弓、自動門機構、空調系統、鐵路制動系統和車鉤製造領域的領導者；和，"}],"markets":[{"en":"We provide our products and services through two principal business segments, the Freight Segment and the Transit Segment, both of which have different market characteristics and business drivers. The Freight Segment primarily manufactures new and modernized locomotives; provides aftermarket parts and services to existing locomotives; provides components to new and existing freight cars; supplies rail control and infrastructure products including electronics, positive train control equipment, signal design and engineering services; provides a comprehensive suite of software-enabled solutions designed to improve customer safety, efficiency and productivity in the transportation and mining industries; overhauls locomotives; provides heat exchangers and cooling systems for rail and other industrial markets; provides nondestructive testing, remote visual inspection and analytical instruments","zh":"我們透過兩個主要業務部門（貨運部門和運輸部門）提供產品和服務，這兩個部門具有不同的市場特徵和業務驅動力。貨運部門主要生產新型現代化機車；為現有機車提供售後零件和服務；為新的和現有的貨車提供組件；提供鐵路控制和基礎設施產品，包括電子產品、主動列車控制設備、信號設計和工程服務；提供一整套基於軟體的解決方案，旨在提高運輸和採礦行業的客戶安全、效率和冷卻系統；"},{"en":"The Transit Segment primarily manufactures and services components for new and existing passenger transit vehicles, typically regional trains, high speed trains, subway cars, light-rail vehicles and buses; and supplies rail control and infrastructure products including electronics, signal design and engineering services. Customers include public transit authorities and municipalities, leasing companies, manufacturers of passenger transit vehicles and buses, and companies in the electrical generation, distribution, and charging industries. In 2025, the Transit Segment accounted for approximately 28% of our total net sales, with approximately 17% of its net sales in the U.S. The Transit Segment maintains a large installed base of original equipment globally which allows for a significant recurring revenue stream in the aftermarket. Approximately 56% of the Transit Segment's net sales are i","zh":"交通部門主要為新的和現有的客運交通車輛製造和維修零件，通常是區域列車、高速列車、地鐵車輛、輕軌車輛和公共汽車；提供鐵路控制和基礎設施產品，包括電子、信號設計和工程服務。客戶包括公共交通當局和市政當局、租賃公司、客運車輛和公共汽車製造商以及發電、配電和充電行業的公司。到 2025 年，運輸部門約占我們總淨銷售額的 28%，其中美國約佔淨銷售額的 17%。運輸部門在全球擁有大量的原始設備安裝基礎，這使得售後市場能夠獲得可觀的經常性收入流。交通部門約 56% 的淨銷售額來自"}],"customers":[{"en":"We serve a global customer base with products and services purchased across international markets. Our customers include passenger transit authorities and railroads throughout North America, Europe, Asia Pacific, Africa, and South America; utilities; manufacturers of transportation equipment, such as locomotives, freight cars, passenger transit vehicles and buses; companies that own, lease, and maintain such equipment; as well as customers in the mining, marine, and industrial markets and applications and companies in the generation, distribution, and charging industries.","zh":"我們透過在國際市場上購買的產品和服務為全球客戶群提供服務。我們的客戶包括北美、歐洲、亞太地區、非洲和南美洲的客運當局和鐵路公司；公用事業；機車、貨車、客運車輛和公共汽車等運輸設備製造商；擁有、租賃和維護此類設備的公司；以及採礦、海洋和工業市場的客戶以及發電、配電和充電行業的應用和公司。"},{"en":"Top customers can change from year to year. For the fiscal year ended December 31, 2025, our top five customers accounted for approximately 30% of net sales. No one customer represents 10% or more of consolidated net sales. We believe that we have strong relationships with all of our key customers.","zh":"頂級客戶每年都會有所變動。截至2025年12月31日的財年，我們的前五大客戶約佔淨銷售額的30%。沒有一位客戶佔合併淨銷售額的 10% 或以上。我們相信我們與所有主要客戶都擁有牢固的關係。"}],"competition":[{"en":"We operate in a highly competitive marketplace. In addition to price, competition is based on product performance and technological leadership, quality, reliability of delivery, and customer service and support.","zh":"我們在競爭激烈的市場中運作。除了價格之外，競爭還基於產品性能和技術領先地位、品質、交付可靠性以及客戶服務和支援。"},{"en":"Our principal competitors vary across product lines and geographies. Within North America, New York Air Brake Company, a subsidiary of the German air brake producer Knorr-Bremse AG (\"Knorr\") and Amsted Rail Company, Inc., a subsidiary of Amsted Industries Corporation, are our principal overall OEM competitors. Our primary competition for locomotives is Progress Rail, owned by a subsidiary of Caterpillar. Our primary competition for freight and passenger transit service and repair is mostly from the railroads' and passenger transit authorities' in-house operations and Knorr. We believe our key strengths, strategic partnerships and operational excellence, coupled with an experienced management team, enable us to compete effectively in this marketplace. Outside of North America, Knorr is our main competitor, although not in every product line or geography. In addition, our competitors often","zh":"我們的主要競爭對手因產品線和地區而異。在北美，紐約空氣煞車公司（德國空氣煞車生產商克諾爾股份公司（「克諾爾」）的子公司）和安施德鐵路公司（安施德工業公司的子公司）是我們主要的整體 OEM 競爭對手。我們機車的主要競爭對手是卡特彼勒子公司擁有的 Progress Rail。我們在貨運和客運運輸服務及維修方面的主要競爭主要來自鐵路和客運運輸當局的內部營運和克諾爾。我們相信，我們的關鍵優勢、策略合作夥伴關係和卓越運營，再加上經驗豐富的管理團隊，使我們能夠在這個市場上有效競爭。在北美以外，克諾爾是我們的主要競爭對手，儘管並非在每個產品線或地區都是如此。此外，我们的竞争对手经常"}],"segments":{"seg":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Freight","val":8036000000,"zh":"貨運部門"},{"name":"Transit","val":3131000000,"zh":"交通段"}],"total":11167000000},"prod":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Product","val":9261000000,"zh":"產品"},{"name":"Service","val":1906000000,"zh":"服務"}],"total":11167000000},"geo":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"North America","val":6192000000,"zh":"北美洲"},{"name":"US","val":5367000000,"zh":"美國"},{"name":"Europe","val":1956000000,"zh":"歐洲"},{"name":"IN","val":699000000,"zh":"印度"},{"name":"Other Europe","val":663000000,"zh":"歐洲其他地區"},{"name":"CA","val":555000000,"zh":"加拿大"},{"name":"South America","val":513000000,"zh":"南美洲"},{"name":"Australia & New Zealand","val":453000000,"zh":"澳洲和紐西蘭"},{"name":"Kazakhstan Russia & CIS","val":431000000,"zh":"哈薩克 俄羅斯及獨聯體"},{"name":"FR","val":419000000,"zh":"FR"}],"total":11167000000}},"peers":["GEHC","CTVA","AME","ROL","IEX"]}}